b002:l028","ordinal":353768,"en":"I won't listen to you if you beg."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l029","ordinal":353769,"en":"If a slanderous demon seizes me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l030","ordinal":353770,"en":"I water your breath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l031","ordinal":353771,"en":"This is how I will bend your back."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l032","ordinal":353772,"en":"Ulugundu, Shereshin."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l033","ordinal":353773,"en":"As if the fire did not cover,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l034","ordinal":353774,"en":"I will mourn your people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l035","ordinal":353775,"en":"If you can, think Kyrgyz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l036","ordinal":353776,"en":"Get used to the saying,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l037","ordinal":353777,"en":"Manas took the statue,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l038","ordinal":353778,"en":"He is a murderer who is dead"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l039","ordinal":353779,"en":"He put a spoon."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b002:l040","ordinal":353780,"en":"Hollow mouth, big eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l001","ordinal":353781,"en":"Take a beautiful girl who plays"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l002","ordinal":353782,"en":"Revenge of gold"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l003","ordinal":353783,"en":"His name is Manas, who was slaughtered by the monster."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l004","ordinal":353784,"en":"Then he got countless animals,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l005","ordinal":353785,"en":"My laughter is over,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l006","ordinal":353786,"en":"He took so much of my property."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l007","ordinal":353787,"en":"Sebil's dress,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l008","ordinal":353788,"en":"Measure out the whip."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l009","ordinal":353789,"en":"My people in Zhelpinish."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l010","ordinal":353790,"en":"It was bad."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l011","ordinal":353791,"en":"The murderer saw the fire,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0750:b003:l012","ordinal":353792,"en":"Her husband is Jar-Manas,"}]
